1767855555\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to unlock content in the game\u2019s shop like new music, new faceplates, buttons, backlights, and even characters for your bubble-popping mayhem! Yarr!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/487350/extras/94e37ea29b622f8848e366a582377248.avif?t=1767855555\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/487350/extras/d812ad26308077d3be902992c1312c58.avif?t=1767855555\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail to the sound of authentic chiptune anthems by renowned artists Harry Waters, GYMS &amp; Matthew Ivic. Every track is a pulse-pounding voyage into classic 8-bit energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/487350/extras/860ed32a6e933ef212a0cfd461cb14cf.avif?t=1767855555\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against friends and players worldwide. Rise through the ranks, and unlock tricky achievements as you perfect your high score runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/487350/extras/c4bebd75ab531fab811c9b40120d693f.avif?t=1767855555\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released 10 years ago, Pirate Pop has had some small bug fixed and a bit of extra polish, to remain the classic score chaser it always was, and stand the test of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta